From ca2c45e8fd37461e2531e11810c2a065ada60b82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan <kloterstefan@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:38:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/16] Vizzbox: the VIZZBOX's controls, screen, favourites;
 new styles while playing; ENDLESS

firmware/src/ui_vizzbox.c: K1..K4 GENRE SUBGENRE ENERGY VARIATION, SELECT TEMPO, ALGO LENGTH, PRESET the
seed, REC NEW, PLAY, HOME + PLAY the GROOVEBOX, FX / ARP / SEQ DROP NOW, BREAK NOW, HOLD, OCT- OCT+; the
black keys MUTE (a tap) and cut (held), with GLO SOLO, as Skiff's GLO layer, CC 103 saying them; the white
keys the lead in the song's scale; SAVE / GLO + a white key store / load one of sixteen favourites, kept in
two sectors of their own at 0x95000 / 0x96000 (fm1_flash_map.h FL_VBOX: no Skiff or Vizz touches them, the
update loader neither), written while stopped. The screen: genre, subgenre, tempo (EXT on an external
clock), key, seed, length, the section and its bar, the whole song's energy with the bar playing, the six
tracks (playing, muted, soloed), the knob turned big, the favourites. Its own LEDs.

firmware/src/producer.c: GENRE, SUBGENRE, the seed or a favourite while playing come in as a DJ would: a
BREAK and a BUILD of 16 with the tempo gliding over it, then the new style's song from its first DROP, in
the same key; its sounds go onto the tracks in the BUILD's silent last beat, in the audio ISR (vb_swap:
prepared in the main loop, every voice stopped there), so a song stays the same bytes. ENDLESS: after 4..8
minutes of a subgenre, at a DROP's end, a related one (a tempo neighbour within 8 BPM, its own genre twice
as likely), its scale where it has another; ambient's cycles without a DROP. ENERGY and VARIATION from the
next section, LENGTH too, TEMPO over four bars. The tails at each bar's tempo.

tests/producer_test.c: every subgenre in every LENGTH (form, tempo, key, registers, voices, the DROPs and
their kick, CC 104..109), determinism (the same song twice and in another main-loop phase: the same MIDI
bytes and audio), transport, SEQ MIDI OUT OFF, the GROOVEBOX, live moves, MUTE and SOLO as CC 103, ENDLESS
for 60 minutes, favourites over a power cycle, VIZZBOX <-> GROOVEBOX. tests/vizzbox_ui.c and its golden:
the new screens in every palette. Both in tests/run_tests.sh.

